{"product_id":"friendly-neighborhood-spider-man-1-secrets-and-rumors","title":"Friendly Neighborhood Spider-Man 1: Secrets and Rumors","description":"\u003cp\u003eSpider-Man is the worst neighbor EVER! There are always crazy villains and property damage and drama and...and he CATCHES the villains. And he tries to fix the damage and he helps carry your groceries and actually that property damage keeps the rents down. You know what? Spider-Man is the best neighbor ever and this book will give you a closer look at Spider-Man's (and Peter Parker's) neighborhood than any book ever. Also, it wouldn't be a Spider-Man adventure without a threat that could destroy not only Spider-Man, but all his neighbors. Superstar writer TOM TAYLOR (X-MEN RED, ALL-NEW WOLVERINE, Injustice) and rising art star JUANN CABAL (ALL-NEW WOLVERINE, X-23) give you the most local Spider-Man ever!COLLECTING: FRIENDLY NEIGHBORHOOD SPIDER-MAN (2019) 1-6\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 152 x 254\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Tom Taylor\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781302916909\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 144\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45803735154841,"sku":"16RA-3-9781302916909","price":30.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68d5050dd2504_Friendly_Neighborhood_Spider-Man_1-_Secrets_and_Rumors_Tom_Taylor.jpg?v=1760808676","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/friendly-neighborhood-spider-man-1-secrets-and-rumors","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}